---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="VirtualStruct &mdash; Projects" ogTitle="VirtualStruct &mdash; Projects"
  description="Projects by Amara Nezli — open source and professional work." showNav={true}>

  <div class="bento-page">
    <div class="bento-grid">

      <!-- Header row -->
      <div class="bcard bcard-full bcard-nav">
        <h1 class="bento-page-title">Projects</h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Professional work -->
      <div class="bcard bcard-full">
        <span class="bcard-section-title">01 — Professional</span>
        <div class="project-grid">
          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://zirak.info" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zirak</a> <span class="badge-private">private src</span></h3>
            <p>Real-time car-sharing platform with WebSocket-based live tracking and booking. <a href="/case-studies/zirak" class="bcard-link">Read the case study</a></p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Laravel</span><span>Reverb</span><span>WebSocket</span><span>Self-hosted</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://docminute.app" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Docminute</a> <span class="badge-private">private src</span></h3>
            <p>On-demand doctor consultation platform.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Laravel</span><span>Node.js</span><span>MySQL</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://heyu.paris" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HeyU</a> <span class="badge-private">private src</span></h3>
            <p>Social discovery app for events and local experiences in Paris.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Laravel</span><span>Node.js</span><span>AWS</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://sherpas.com" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sherpas</a> <span class="badge-private">private src</span></h3>
            <p>Tutoring marketplace. Led the legacy code migration and new feature releases.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Laravel</span><span>MySQL</span><span>Docker</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3>Gratify <span class="badge-private">private</span></h3>
            <p>Rewards and loyalty platform built from scratch.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Laravel</span><span>Node.js</span><span>Redis</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3>Zer <span class="badge-private">private</span></h3>
            <p>Internal operations platform.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Node.js</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Docker</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://dzvolt.com/en/software/dzvolt-ui" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DzVolt UI</a> <span class="badge-private">private src</span></h3>
            <p>Desktop app for monitoring and controlling industrial I/O over Modbus RTU, with real-time browser streaming, role-based access, and tamper-evident audit logging.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Desktop</span><span>Modbus RTU</span><span>Cross-platform</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3>Your project here</h3>
            <p>Have a project in mind? I am open to freelance and remote work.</p>
            <a href="mailto:n.amara@protonmail.ch" class="btn-solid" style="margin-top:14px">contact me for a project</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Open source -->
      <div class="bcard bcard-full">
        <span class="bcard-section-title">02 — Open Source</span>
        <div class="project-grid">
          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://hihebark.github.io/appwire/" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Appwire</a></h3>
            <p>Live REPL for inspecting a running app — run code against real service instances.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Node.js</span><span>NestJS</span><span>REPL</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://fanar-app.github.io/" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fanar</a></h3>
            <p>Debugging tool that streams objects, errors, SQL queries, and performance metrics from any runtime to a real-time desktop app.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Debugging</span><span>Desktop</span><span>Open Source</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/nestjs-query-profiler" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nestjs-query-profiler</a></h3>
            <p>NestJS module for profiling database query performance. <a href="/notes/profiling-typeorm-queries-in-nestjs" class="bcard-link">Read the write-up</a></p>
            <div class="stack"><span>NestJS</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>npm</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/hihebark/QuranReader" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">QuranReader</a></h3>
            <p>Native GNOME application for reading the Quran.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Python</span><span>GTK4</span><span>libadwaita</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/hihebark/bevor" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bevor</a></h3>
            <p>HTTP request and payload validator.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Go</span><span>Security</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/hihebark/Duxe" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Duxe</a></h3>
            <p>Information gathering and reconnaissance tool.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Go</span><span>Security</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/hihebark/godirsearch" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">godirsearch</a></h3>
            <p>Fast directory and path enumeration tool for web targets.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Go</span><span>Security</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry">
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/hihebark/horcrux-js" class="card-title-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Horcrux-js</a></h3>
            <p>Split a file into encrypted shards using Shamir's Secret Sharing.</p>
            <div class="stack"><span>Node.js</span><span>Cryptography</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-entry grid-more">
            <a href="https://github.com/hihebark" class="bcard-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">browse more on my github</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
